      <exclusiveGateway name="Accounting adjustment required?"
                         id="_58ae3567-3809-47c7-9c73-61c6983e8070">
         <documentation id="documentation_58ae3567-3809-47c7-9c73-61c6983e8070"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-006; CSP-AC-002.
 
Decision: Route the assessed item according to the accounting adjustmentt requirement.
 
Yes: A controlled adjustment is required and has been defined.
 
No: The assessment confirms that no adjustment is required. Continue with the applicable accounting and NAV outcome checks.
 
Undetermined: The available evidence is insufficient to determine the requirement. Continue with investigation or escalation; do not treat an unresolved assessment as No.]]></documentation>
